flowchart TD
  accTitle: Information moving through an agent task
  accDescr: A user brief and relevant repository files inform an agent. Optional skills guide it, tools act on artifacts, and evidence returns to the next decision.
  A["User brief and constraints"] -->|Intent| D["Agent chooses an action"]
  B["Relevant files and current docs"] -->|Facts and conventions| D
  C["Available skill, when relevant"] -.->|Procedure| D
  D -->|Arguments| E["Tool via CLI, API, or MCP"]
  E -->|Changes| F["Code, game build, or video"]
  F --> G["Tests and human review"]
  G -->|Observed result| H["Evidence and decision log"]
  H -->|Context for next change| D
